		+ "a merge; a drop from the file explorer already open on that folder is the gesture"
		+ "players expect. The order of a two-file drop matters only when neither save or both name"
		+ "Prime (@RULE.TheSaveOnPrimeBecomesSaveA); taking the alphabetical order keeps the web UI"
		+ "and the command merging the same pair the same way, and the swap button reverses it when"
