		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/decisions.awawa::DECISION"
			+ "AnAnchorNamesAFileTrackedByGit"
		IMPL "agents/corpus-ecrire.md::Les saves des scénarios ne le sont pas"
		IMPL "packages/ui-save-manager/e2e/fixtures/README.md::They are not committed"
	RATIONALE "The owner ruled while refining DOCS50 that the generated saves need not be committed"
		+ "and that the anchors move off them; six ATTESTED_BY of the specification, five on rules"
		+ "and one on the section TerrainLayers, and one IMPL of"
		+ "AUiScenarioAssertsWhatTheScreenShows name those files today, while the IMPL naming the"
		+ "README of the fixtures stays valid. The design was settled while refining this task on"
		+ "2026-09-25: a Playwright global setup writes the saves into the same directory, ignored"
		+ "by git, so no scenario path changes, the scenario FEAT119 adds included, and a direct"
		+ "playwright test run gets them too; that setup runs under Node, where Bun.write does not"
		+ "exist. The byte replay is dropped, since the scenarios read what the generator has just"
